<Base title="Editorial Policy | TheWorthScout"><article class="wrap prose"><div class="eyebrow">Our standards</div><h1>Editorial Policy</h1><h2>Research and sourcing</h2><p>We aim to use product documentation, reputable sources, and verifiable information. When a guide is based on desk research rather than direct testing, we make that distinction clear.</p><h2>Accuracy and updates</h2><p>Features, pricing, and availability can change. Readers should verify important details with the provider before purchasing. We aim to correct material errors when identified.</p><h2>Affiliate independence</h2><p>Some links may earn us a commission. We aim to evaluate products on their merits and disclose commercial relationships clearly.</p><h2>Reviews and ratings</h2><p>We do not publish invented user experiences, fabricated tests, or unsupported ratings.</p></article></Base>
